  "proof_boundary": "This receipt records that lean4/ConstructorTheoryMediatorEntanglement.lean type-checks and which axioms its #print axioms lines report. The declarations state a finite shadow only: one linear local map A (x) B does not raise the rank of the coefficient matrix of a pure bipartite state (any finite dimension over a field), and over Q(i) no 2x2 pair (A, B) carries the product state (1,1,1,1)/2 to the phase state with u=(3+4i)/5 of squared concurrence 1/5. The imported mediated-entanglement inference (Marletto-Vedral, Bose et al.) is not reduced to or proved from them; node status stays IMPORTED_ASSUMPTION.",
